# Pipeline outputs. The raw tracked pose JSON is far too large to track
# (~351 MB), but the final validated report of the 126-video run is kept as
# the record of that result.
#
# Note the shape: git will not re-include a file whose parent directory is
# excluded, so each level is excluded by contents (dir/*) and re-included in
# turn rather than excluding the directory itself.
fms_outputs/*
!fms_outputs/reports/
fms_outputs/reports/*
!fms_outputs/reports/all_samples_report.json
fms_outputs_smoke/
tracked_data/

